abstract: "Research toward a speaking AI whose knowledge is printed into memory rather than trained into model weights. This repository: independent Rust research into RAM-resident knowledge, exact source-bound readout, reproducible integrity checks, synthetic Q8 experiments and large-scale memory/Ocean evidence."
